<div class="pz-about-page page-width" style="max-width: 820px; margin: 3.5rem auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; font-family: 'Barlow', system-ui, sans-serif;">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    <span style="font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #ef4444; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">Our Story &amp; Craft</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;">Transforming Blank Walls into Art</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto;">
      Born out of an obsession with anime, automotive racing, cinema, and modern room aesthetics, we build premium wall setups that turn ordinary bedrooms into personal creative sanctuaries.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin: 3rem 0; text-align: center;">
    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; color: #000;">5,00,000+</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.25rem 0 0;">Walls Transformed</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; color: #000;">300 GSM</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.25rem 0 0;">Thick Matte Paper</p>
    </div>
    <div style="background: #f8fafc; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 2.25rem; font-weight: 900; margin: 0; color: #000;">4.9 ★</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 700; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; margin: 0.25rem 0 0;">43,000+ Happy Reviews</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #334155;">
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111; margin-top: 0;">Why Posterized?</h3>
    <p>Standard posters curl, reflect bedroom glare, and tear easily. We engineered our wall sets using high-density 300 GSM matte cardstock with anti-glare coatings so your favorite characters and motorsports artwork look razor-sharp from any viewing angle.</p>
    
    <h3 style="font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; color: #111; margin-top: 1.5rem;">Pre-Applied Wall Tape</h3>
    <p>No drills. No hammers. No ruined paint. We provide free pre-cut high-tack tape designed specifically for Indian indoor wall textures.</p>
  </div>
</div>

